          "stats": {
            "id": "levelled_description_bccc9b4db964",
            "level": {
              "value": 1
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "You are a cel rau, child of a strigoi, one of the first vampires to walk Golarion. Your heritage ties you to the Shadow Plane and grants you strange resilience to light and darkness alike. You gain a +1 circumstance bonus to saving throws against effects with the darkness, light, or shadow traits, and whenever you become dazzled or blinded for at least 2 rounds, you can reduce the duration by 1 round."
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
